#: templates/whispers/about.html:9
#, python-format
msgid "About %(brand_name)s"
msgstr "Tungkol sa %(brand_name)s"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:10
msgid ""
"A privacy focused app for sharing secrets securely. We call them whispers."
msgstr ""
"Isang app na nakatuon sa pagkapribado para sa ligtas na pagbabahagi ng mga "
"lihim. Tinatawag namin ang mga ito na whispers."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:13
msgid ""
"<em class=\"text-white\">“Psst… wanna hear a secret?”</em> When you share a "
"secret in person, you lean in and whisper it, so only the person next to you "
"can hear. That is where the name <strong class=\"text-white\">psst-secret</"
"strong> comes from."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"text-white\">“Psst… gusto mo bang makarinig ng sikreto?”</em> "
"Kapag nagbabahagi ka ng sikreto nang personal, lumalapit ka at ibinubulong "
"ito, para ang taong katabi mo lamang ang makarinig. Diyan nagmula ang "
"pangalang <strong class=\"text-white\">psst-secret</strong>."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:15
msgid ""
"<em class=\"text-white\">“Psst… wanna hear a secret?”</em> When you share a "
"secret in person, you lean in and whisper it, so only the person next to you "
"can hear."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"text-white\">“Psst… gusto mo bang makarinig ng sikreto?”</em> "
"Kapag nagbabahagi ka ng sikreto nang personal, lumalapit ka at ibinubulong "
"ito, para ang taong katabi mo lamang ang makarinig."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:17
msgid ""
"A whisper here works the same way. It is a private, end-to-end encrypted "
"exchange between two people: the one who shares it and the one who receives "
"it. Your browser encrypts it before it leaves your device, and only someone "
"with the full link — and the password, if one is set — can decrypt it. The "
"server in the middle only ever passes along sealed data it cannot read."
msgstr ""
"Ganoon din gumagana ang whisper dito. Isa itong pribado at end-to-end "
"encrypted na palitan sa pagitan ng dalawang tao: ang nagbabahagi nito at ang "
"tumatanggap nito. Ine-encrypt ito ng iyong browser bago ito umalis sa iyong "
"device, at ang may buong link lamang — at ang password, kung may itinakda — "
"ang makakapag-decrypt nito. Ang server sa gitna ay nagpapasa lamang ng "
"selyadong data na hindi nito mababasa."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:18
msgid ""
"And like a real whisper, it does not linger. A whisper can vanish the moment "
"it is read, and every whisper expires. You can whisper to someone, or ask "
"someone to whisper to you."
msgstr ""
"At tulad ng tunay na bulong, hindi ito nagtatagal. Maaaring maglaho ang "
"whisper sa sandaling mabasa ito, at nag-e-expire ang bawat whisper. Maaari "
"kang bumulong sa iba, o hilingin sa iba na bumulong sa iyo."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:24
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "Paano ito gumagana"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:26
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(brand_name)s ensures that <strong class=\"text-white\">your whispers never "
"exist in plaintext on our server</strong>. All encryption and decryption "
"happens entirely in your browser using the <a href=\"https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Crypto_API\" class=\"text-"
"brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Web Crypto API</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tinitiyak ng %(brand_name)s na <strong class=\"text-white\">hindi kailanman "
"nasa plaintext ang iyong mga whisper sa aming server</strong>. Lahat ng pag-"
"encrypt at pag-decrypt ay nangyayari lamang sa iyong browser gamit ang <a "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Crypto_API\" "
"class=\"text-brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Web Crypto API</a>."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:28
msgid "Send Mode"
msgstr "Mode ng pagpapadala"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:29
msgid ""
"Share a whisper with someone. The key travels only inside the link you share."
msgstr ""
"Magbahagi ng whisper sa isang tao. Kasama lamang ang susi sa link na "
"ibinabahagi mo."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:32
msgid "Creating a Whisper"
msgstr "Paglikha ng whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:34
msgid "You type your whisper in the browser"
msgstr "Ita-type mo ang iyong whisper sa browser"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:35
msgid ""
"A random <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">AES-256-GCM</strong> key is "
"generated client-side"
msgstr ""
"Gumagawa ng random na susi para sa <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">AES-256-"
"GCM</strong> sa panig ng kliyente"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:36
msgid "Your whisper is encrypted in-browser"
msgstr "Ine-encrypt ang iyong whisper sa browser"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:37
msgid "Only the <em>ciphertext</em> is sent to the server"
msgstr "Ang <em>ciphertext</em> lamang ang ipinapadala sa server"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:38
msgid ""
"The decryption key is placed in the URL fragment (<code class=\"text-"
"brand-300\">#key</code>)"
msgstr ""
"Inilalagay ang susi para sa pag-decrypt sa fragment ng URL (<code "
"class=\"text-brand-300\">#key</code>)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:42
msgid "Viewing a Whisper"
msgstr "Pagtingin sa whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:44
msgid "You open the shared link"
msgstr "Bubuksan mo ang ibinahaging link"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:45
msgid "The server returns the ciphertext"
msgstr "Ibabalik ng server ang ciphertext"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:46
msgid "The key from the URL fragment decrypts it in-browser"
msgstr "Ide-decrypt ito sa browser gamit ang susi mula sa fragment ng URL"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:47
msgid "You see the plaintext — the server never does"
msgstr "Makikita mo ang plaintext — hindi ito kailanman makikita ng server"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:51
msgid ""
"Send mode uses only symmetric encryption (<strong class='text-"
"gray-200'>AES-256-GCM</strong>), which is not broken by quantum computers. "
"The known quantum attack on symmetric ciphers (Grover's algorithm) at most "
"halves the effective key strength, leaving 128 bits — still far beyond "
"reach. Shor's algorithm, the real quantum threat, only affects public-key "
"cryptography, which send mode does not use."
msgstr ""
"Symmetric encryption (<strong class='text-gray-200'>AES-256-GCM</strong>) "
"lamang ang ginagamit ng mode ng pagpapadala, at hindi ito nababasag ng mga "
"quantum computer. Ang kilalang quantum attack sa mga symmetric cipher "
"(algorithm ni Grover) ay kayang magpababa ng epektibong lakas ng susi nang "
"hanggang kalahati lamang, kaya may natitirang 128 bit — na hindi pa rin "
"kayang basagin. Ang algorithm ni Shor, ang tunay na banta mula sa mga "
"quantum computer, ay nakaaapekto lamang sa cryptography na gumagamit ng "
"pampublikong susi, na hindi ginagamit ng mode ng pagpapadala."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:53
msgid "Receive Mode"
msgstr "Mode ng pagtanggap"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:54
msgid ""
"Ask someone to send a whisper <em>to you</em>. Receive mode uses public-key "
"encryption, so the person submitting can encrypt but never decrypt."
msgstr ""
"Hilingin sa isang tao na magpadala ng whisper <em>sa iyo</em>. Gumagamit ang "
"mode ng pagtanggap ng encryption na may pampublikong susi, kaya maaaring mag-"
"encrypt ang nagsusumite ngunit hindi kailanman mag-decrypt."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:57
msgid "Creating a Request"
msgstr "Paglikha ng kahilingan"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:59
msgid ""
"Your browser generates a key pair using <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">X-"
"Wing</strong>, a hybrid of <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">ML-KEM-768</"
"strong> (post-quantum, FIPS 203) and <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">X25519</"
"strong>"
msgstr ""
"Gumagawa ang iyong browser ng pares ng susi gamit ang <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-200\">X-Wing</strong>, isang hybrid ng <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-200\">ML-KEM-768</strong> (post-quantum, FIPS 203) at <strong "
"class=\"text-gray-200\">X25519</strong>"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:60
msgid ""
"The public key is stored on the server. The submit link contains only its "
"fingerprint, so the server cannot swap in a key of its own"
msgstr ""
"Iniimbak ang pampublikong susi sa server. Ang fingerprint lamang nito ang "
"nasa link para sa pagsusumite, kaya hindi ito mapapalitan ng server ng "
"sarili nitong susi"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:61
msgid ""
"The private key seed stays in your view link fragment (or is encrypted with "
"your password)"
msgstr ""
"Nananatili ang seed ng pribadong susi sa fragment ng iyong link para sa "
"pagtingin (o ine-encrypt gamit ang iyong password)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:62
msgid "You share the submit link and keep the view link"
msgstr ""
"Ibabahagi mo ang link para sa pagsusumite at itatago ang link para sa "
"pagtingin"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:66
msgid "Submitting & Viewing"
msgstr "Pagsusumite at pagtingin"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:68
msgid "The sender opens the submit link and types their whisper"
msgstr ""
"Bubuksan ng nagpadala ang link para sa pagsusumite at ita-type ang kanyang "
"whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:69
msgid ""
"The sender's browser encrypts to your public key and uploads only the "
"ciphertext"
msgstr ""
"Ine-encrypt ng browser ng nagpadala ang nilalaman gamit ang iyong "
"pampublikong susi at ciphertext lamang ang ina-upload"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:70
msgid "You open your view link"
msgstr "Bubuksan mo ang iyong link para sa pagtingin"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:71
msgid "Only your view link can decrypt it"
msgstr "Ang iyong link para sa pagtingin lamang ang makapagde-decrypt nito"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:75
msgid ""
"The submit link and view link use different identifiers. Someone who gets "
"hold of the submit link cannot find, read, or burn the submitted whisper."
msgstr ""
"Magkaiba ang identifier ng link para sa pagsusumite at ng link para sa "
"pagtingin. Hindi mahahanap, mababasa, o mabubura ang naisumiteng whisper ng "
"sinumang makakuha ng link para sa pagsusumite."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:76
msgid ""
"Revealing a newly created whisper requires the authorization token in the "
"complete view link. The address alone cannot use up a view. Your decryption "
"key stays in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Kailangan ang token ng awtorisasyon sa kumpletong link sa pagtingin upang "
"ibunyag ang isang bagong likhang bulong. Hindi makakagamit ng isang "
"pagtingin ang address lamang. Nananatili sa iyong browser ang susi sa pag-"
"decrypt."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:77
msgid ""
"Because the key exchange is hybrid, the whisper stays protected as long as "
"either algorithm holds — including against attackers who record traffic "
"today and hope to decrypt it with a quantum computer later."
msgstr ""
"Dahil hybrid ang pagpapalitan ng susi, mananatiling protektado ang whisper "
"hangga't ligtas ang kahit isa sa mga algorithm — kabilang laban sa mga "
"umaatake na nagrerekord ng trapiko ngayon at umaasang ma-decrypt ito gamit "
"ang quantum computer sa hinaharap."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:83
msgid "Why the URL Fragment?"
msgstr "Bakit ang fragment ng URL?"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:85
msgid ""
"The decryption key is stored after the <code class='bg-gray-900 px-1.5 "
"py-0.5 rounded text-brand-300'>#</code> in the URL, known as the fragment. "
"The URI specification (<a href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/"
"rfc3986#section-3.5' class='text-brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300' "
"target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>RFC 3986 §3.5</a>) reserves the "
"fragment for processing by the browser, and the HTTP specification (<a "
"href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110#section-7.1' class='text-"
"brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300' target='_blank' rel='noopener "
"noreferrer'>RFC 9110 §7.1</a>) excludes it from the request — so <strong "
"class='text-white'>the URL fragment is never sent to the server</strong>. "
"This means:"
msgstr ""
"Iniimbak ang susi para sa pag-decrypt pagkatapos ng <code class='bg-gray-900 "
"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-brand-300'>#</code> sa URL, sa tinatawag na "
"fragment. Inilalaan ng espesipikasyon ng URI (<a href='https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.5' class='text-brand-400 underline "
"hover:text-brand-300' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>RFC 3986 "
"§3.5</a>) ang fragment para iproseso ng browser, at hindi ito isinasama sa "
"request ayon sa espesipikasyon ng HTTP (<a href='https://www.rfc-editor.org/"
"rfc/rfc9110#section-7.1' class='text-brand-400 underline hover:text-"
"brand-300' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>RFC 9110 §7.1</a>) — "
"kaya <strong class='text-white'>hindi kailanman ipinapadala ang fragment ng "
"URL sa server</strong>. Ibig sabihin nito:"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:87
msgid "The server never receives the decryption key"
msgstr "Hindi kailanman natatanggap ng server ang susi para sa pag-decrypt"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:88
msgid "The key doesn't appear in server logs or analytics"
msgstr "Hindi lumalabas ang susi sa mga log ng server o sa analytics"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:89
msgid "Even if the server is compromised, your whispers remain encrypted"
msgstr ""
"Kahit makompromiso ang server, mananatiling naka-encrypt ang iyong mga "
"whisper"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:96
msgid "Password Protection"
msgstr "Proteksiyon gamit ang password"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:98
msgid ""
"Optionally, you can set a password when creating a whisper. When a password "
"is used:"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang magtakda ng password kapag lumilikha ng whisper. Kapag gumamit "
"ng password:"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:100
msgid ""
"The encryption key is derived from your password using <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-200\">PBKDF2</strong> (600,000 iterations, SHA-256)"
msgstr ""
"Kinukuha ang susi para sa pag-encrypt mula sa iyong password gamit ang "
"<strong class=\"text-gray-200\">PBKDF2</strong> (600,000 pag-uulit, SHA-256)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:101
msgid ""
"A random <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">salt</strong> is generated and "
"stored on the server (useless without the password)"
msgstr ""
"Gumagawa ng random na <strong class=\"text-gray-200\">salt</strong> at "
"iniimbak ito sa server (walang silbi kung wala ang password)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:102
msgid ""
"The URL contains <em>no key fragment</em> — only the password holder can "
"decrypt"
msgstr ""
"<em>Walang fragment na may susi</em> ang URL — ang may hawak lamang ng "
"password ang makapagde-decrypt"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:103
msgid ""
"For receive requests, the password protects your private key instead. The "
"sender does not need it — only you do, to open the view link"
msgstr ""
"Para sa mga kahilingan sa pagtanggap, ang iyong pribadong susi naman ang "
"pinoprotektahan ng password. Hindi ito kailangan ng nagpadala — ikaw lamang "
"ang nangangailangan nito upang buksan ang link para sa pagtingin"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:104
msgid "This provides an extra layer of security for highly sensitive data"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ito ng dagdag na proteksiyon para sa lubhang sensitibong datos"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:111
msgid "Enabled Features for This Deployment"
msgstr "Mga Naka-enable na Feature sa Deployment na Ito"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:112
msgid ""
"The administrator of this site has configured it as follows. These settings "
"apply to everyone using it."
msgstr ""
"Ganito kinonfigure ng administrator ang site na ito. Nalalapat ang mga "
"setting na ito sa lahat ng gumagamit nito."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:129
msgid "Security Features"
msgstr "Mga tampok sa seguridad"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:132
msgid "Burn After Reading"
msgstr "Burahin pagkatapos basahin"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:134
msgid ""
"Whispers marked as burn-after-read are <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-300\">permanently deleted</strong> the moment they are viewed — not "
"just flagged, but gone."
msgstr ""
"Ang mga whisper na nakatakdang burahin pagkatapos basahin ay <strong "
"class=\"text-gray-300\">permanenteng binubura</strong> sa sandaling tingnan "
"ang mga ito — hindi lamang minamarkahan, kundi talagang nawawala."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:136
msgid ""
"Whispers marked as burn-after-read are <strong class=\"text-"
"gray-300\">permanently erased from memory</strong> the moment they are "
"viewed — not just flagged, but gone."
msgstr ""
"Ang mga whisper na nakatakdang burahin pagkatapos basahin ay <strong "
"class=\"text-gray-300\">permanenteng binubura sa memory</strong> sa "
"sandaling tingnan ang mga ito — hindi lamang minamarkahan, kundi talagang "
"nawawala."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:140
msgid "Auto-Expiry"
msgstr "Awtomatikong pag-expire"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:141
msgid ""
"All whispers require an expiration time (5 minutes to 1 month). Expired "
"whispers are automatically evicted from Redis via TTL and continuously "
"purged by a background process."
msgstr ""
"Lahat ng whisper ay kailangang may oras ng pag-expire (5 minuto hanggang 1 "
"buwan). Awtomatikong inaalis sa Redis ang mga nag-expire na whisper gamit "
"ang TTL at patuloy na nililinis ng prosesong tumatakbo sa background."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:145
msgid ""
"Industry-standard authenticated encryption. Provides both confidentiality "
"and integrity — any tampering with the ciphertext is detected."
msgstr ""
"Authenticated encryption na pamantayan sa industriya. Nagbibigay ng pagiging "
"kumpidensiyal at integridad — natutukoy ang anumang pakikialam sa ciphertext."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:148
msgid "Post-Quantum Ready"
msgstr "Handa para sa mga quantum computer"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:149
msgid ""
"Send mode uses 256-bit symmetric keys, which remain secure against quantum "
"computers. Receive mode uses the hybrid ML-KEM-768 + X25519 key exchange."
msgstr ""
"Gumagamit ang mode ng pagpapadala ng mga 256-bit na symmetric na susi, na "
"nananatiling ligtas laban sa mga quantum computer. Gumagamit ang mode ng "
"pagtanggap ng hybrid na pagpapalitan ng susi na ML-KEM-768 + X25519."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:152
msgid "Secret Generator"
msgstr "Generator ng lihim"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:153
msgid ""
"Need a fresh password to share? Generate a random password or an English "
"passphrase directly in your browser, using its cryptographically secure "
"random number generator. You choose the length, character types, words, and "
"symbols — nothing is sent to the server until you encrypt the whisper."
msgstr ""
"Kailangan mo ba ng bagong password na ibabahagi? Gumawa ng random na "
"password o English na passphrase nang direkta sa iyong browser, gamit ang "
"cryptographically secure na random number generator nito. Ikaw ang pipili ng "
"haba, mga uri ng karakter, mga salita, at mga simbolo — walang ipinapadala "
"sa server hangga't hindi mo ine-encrypt ang whisper."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:156
msgid "Zero Knowledge"
msgstr "Walang kaalaman sa nilalaman"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:158
msgid ""
"The server stores only encrypted data and public key material in Redis. It "
"has no ability to decrypt your data, even under compulsion."
msgstr ""
"Naka-encrypt na datos at materyal ng pampublikong susi lamang ang iniimbak "
"ng server sa Redis. Hindi nito kayang i-decrypt ang iyong datos, kahit "
"pilitin pa ito."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:160
msgid ""
"The server stores only encrypted data and public key material — and only in "
"volatile memory (Redis). It has no ability to decrypt your data, even under "
"compulsion."
msgstr ""
"Naka-encrypt na datos at materyal ng pampublikong susi lamang ang iniimbak "
"ng server — at sa pansamantalang memory lamang (Redis). Hindi nito kayang i-"
"decrypt ang iyong datos, kahit pilitin pa ito."

#: templates/whispers/about.html:168
msgid "What the Server Stores"
msgstr "Ano ang iniimbak ng server"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:172
msgid "Redis (with persistence enabled)"
msgstr "Redis (may pag-iimbak sa disk)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:174
msgid "Redis (in-memory only — never touches disk)"
msgstr "Redis (sa memory lamang — hindi kailanman isinusulat sa disk)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:179 templates/whispers/about.html:201
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Field"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:180 templates/whispers/about.html:202
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Layunin"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:184
msgid "Your encrypted data (useless without the key)"
msgstr "Ang iyong naka-encrypt na datos (walang silbi kung wala ang susi)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:185
msgid "Random initialization vector for AES-GCM"
msgstr "Random na initialization vector para sa AES-GCM"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:186
msgid "PBKDF2 salt (only if password-protected)"
msgstr "Salt ng PBKDF2 (kapag protektado lamang ng password)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:187
msgid "Receive mode: your X-Wing public key (can only encrypt)"
msgstr ""
"Mode ng pagtanggap: ang iyong pampublikong susi ng X-Wing (pang-encrypt "
"lamang)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:188
msgid ""
"Receive mode: the sender's key encapsulation (useless without your private "
"key)"
msgstr ""
"Mode ng pagtanggap: ang key encapsulation ng nagpadala (walang silbi kung "
"wala ang iyong pribadong susi)"

#: templates/whispers/about.html:189
msgid ""
"Receive mode: your private key seed encrypted with your password (only if "
"password-protected)"
msgstr ""
